#: ../developer/rag-chat.md:1
msgid "Docs RAG Assistant"
msgstr "文档 RAG 助手"

#: ../developer/rag-chat.md:3
msgid ""
"The docs assistant answers users' questions from the deployment's public "
"user docs, using retrieval-augmented generation (RAG). It needs the docs "
"as Markdown, an index built from them, and an API key to call the gateway"
" with. Until all three exist it answers `503`; a checkout without a "
"distribution has none of them. It is an early feature with known "
"[limitations](#limitations)."
msgstr ""
"文档助手使用检索增强生成（RAG），根据部署的公开用户文档回答用户的问题。它需要 Markdown "
"格式的文档、由文档构建的索引，以及一个用来调用网关的 API 密钥。三者齐备之前，它一律返回 "
"`503`；没有发行版的检出这三样都没有。这是一项早期功能，存在已知的[限制](#limitations)。"

#: ../developer/rag-chat.md:5
msgid "How it works"
msgstr "工作原理"

#: ../developer/rag-chat.md:7
msgid ""
"`/v1/rag/chat` retrieves in-process and calls the gateway's own public "
"API, as a user, for the model work:"
msgstr "`/v1/rag/chat` 在进程内完成检索，并以用户身份调用网关自己的公开 API 完成模型推理："

#: ../developer/rag-chat.md:18
msgid ""
"Both calls present `RAG_API_KEY`, so they go through the normal "
"`/v1/embeddings` and `/v1/chat/completions` handlers and are logged and "
"counted toward cost, quota and concurrency like any request. Calling the "
"router in-process would skip those checks. The calls also carry `X-On-"
"Behalf-Of: <user id>`, so the signed-in user is charged and their daily "
"and monthly quotas apply (an account without an API key gets the daily "
"quota its first key would). The gateway honors that header only on "
"requests made with `RAG_API_KEY`. Log rows carry `metadata.user_agent = "
"\"doc_assistant\"`. An upstream `429` is passed through and may mean the "
"user's daily quota is spent."
msgstr ""
"两次调用都使用 `RAG_API_KEY`，因此会经过常规的 `/v1/embeddings` 和 `/v1/chat/completions` "
"处理器，像任何请求一样记入日志，并计入费用、额度和并发。在进程内直接调用 router 会跳过这些检查。这两次调用还带有 `X-On-"
"Behalf-Of: <user id>`，因此费用记在已登录用户名下，并受其每日和每月额度约束（没有 API "
"密钥的账户适用其第一个密钥将获得的每日额度）。网关只在使用 `RAG_API_KEY` 的请求上认可这个请求头。日志行带有 "
"`metadata.user_agent = \"doc_assistant\"`。上游的 `429` "
"会原样传回，可能表示该用户的每日额度已用完。"

#: ../developer/rag-chat.md:20
msgid ""
"The corpus is the active distribution overlay's "
"`<overlay>/content/docs/docs/source/*.md`, the Markdown that builds its "
"public doc site. The index is a JSON file searched with pure-Python "
"cosine similarity, by default `<overlay>/content/rag/docs_index.json`. "
"`RAG_CORPUS_DIR` and `RAG_INDEX_PATH` override these paths; without an "
"overlay you must set them."
msgstr ""
"语料是当前发行版 overlay 的 `<overlay>/content/docs/docs/source/*.md`，即构建其公开文档站的 "
"Markdown。索引是一个用纯 Python 余弦相似度检索的 JSON 文件，默认为 "
"`<overlay>/content/rag/docs_index.json`。`RAG_CORPUS_DIR` 和 "
"`RAG_INDEX_PATH` 可覆盖这两个路径；没有 overlay 时必须设置它们。"

#: ../developer/rag-chat.md:22
msgid "Setting it up"
msgstr "搭建"

#: ../developer/rag-chat.md:24
msgid ""
"Set `RAG_API_KEY` to a user API key, and `RAG_API_BASE_URL` to the "
"gateway's own address. The default, `http://localhost:8080/v1`, is the "
"Compose backend's port; if your backend listens elsewhere, every RAG "
"request fails until you set it. Both are on the admin console's "
"**Settings** tab, under **Setup** → **Integrations**."
msgstr ""
"把 `RAG_API_KEY` 设为一个用户 API 密钥，把 `RAG_API_BASE_URL` 设为网关自己的地址。默认值 "
"`http://localhost:8080/v1` 是 Compose 后端的端口；如果后端监听在别处，不设置它的话每个 RAG "
"请求都会失败。两者都在管理控制台的 **Settings** 标签页中 **Setup** → **Integrations** 下。"

#: ../developer/rag-chat.md:25
msgid "Build the index with a real embedding model, through a gateway:"
msgstr "通过网关用真实的 embedding 模型构建索引："

#: ../developer/rag-chat.md:31
msgid ""
"`RAG_GATEWAY_BASE_URL` chooses the gateway; it defaults to "
"`http://localhost:8080/v1`, your own, because embedding is billable work."
" The key must be a user API key on that gateway. If the `DB_*` settings "
"in `.env` reach the gateway's database, stored settings win over the "
"command line; if not, the tool warns and uses the environment (with "
"`DB_ENABLED=false` it doesn't try)."
msgstr ""
"`RAG_GATEWAY_BASE_URL` 选择使用哪个网关；它默认为 "
"`http://localhost:8080/v1`，即你自己的网关，因为 embedding 是要计费的工作。密钥必须是该网关上的用户 API "
"密钥。如果 `.env` 中的 `DB_*` "
"设置能连上网关的数据库，已存储的设置优先于命令行；否则工具会发出警告并使用环境变量（`DB_ENABLED=false` 时不会尝试连接）。"

#: ../developer/rag-chat.md:32
msgid ""
"Make the JSON file readable at `RAG_INDEX_PATH`. Compose mounts the "
"overlay into the backend, so replacing the file under the overlay's "
"`content/rag/` is enough; each process reloads the index when the file's "
"modification time changes."
msgstr ""
"让 `RAG_INDEX_PATH` 处的 JSON 文件可读。Compose 会把 overlay 挂载进后端，因此替换 overlay 的 "
"`content/rag/` 下的文件即可；每个进程会在文件修改时间变化时重新加载索引。"

#: ../developer/rag-chat.md:33
msgid "Check `GET /v1/rag/status`."
msgstr "检查 `GET /v1/rag/status`。"

#: ../developer/rag-chat.md:35
msgid ""
"Queries are embedded with the embedder recorded in the index. If the "
"query vector's dimension doesn't match the index, the endpoint fails with"
" `502`, so rebuild the index whenever you change embedders. For "
"development and CI without a gateway, `RAG_EMBEDDER=hash make rag-ingest`"
" builds an offline index with weak retrieval."
msgstr ""
"查询使用索引中记录的 embedder 进行嵌入。如果查询向量的维度与索引不符，端点会以 `502` 失败，因此每次更换 embedder "
"后都要重建索引。在没有网关的开发和 CI 环境中，`RAG_EMBEDDER=hash make rag-ingest` "
"会构建一个离线索引，检索效果较弱。"

#: ../developer/rag-chat.md:37
msgid ""
"To check whether the committed index still matches the corpus, without "
"embedding anything or calling a gateway:"
msgstr "要检查已提交的索引是否仍与语料一致（不做任何嵌入，也不调用网关）："

#: ../developer/rag-chat.md:43
msgid ""
"It exits `0` when the index is current, `1` when it has drifted and `2` "
"when it cannot tell."
msgstr "索引是最新的时退出码为 `0`，已经过时为 `1`，无法判断为 `2`。"

#: ../developer/rag-chat.md:45
msgid "Endpoints"
msgstr "端点"

#: ../developer/rag-chat.md:47
msgid ""
"Both authenticate with the dashboard JWT (`get_current_user`), so the "
"Next.js chat page calls them with the session token it already holds."
msgstr "两者都用仪表盘 JWT（`get_current_user`）认证，因此 Next.js 聊天页面用它已有的会话令牌调用它们。"

#: ../developer/rag-chat.md:49
msgid ""
"`GET /v1/rag/status` returns `index_loaded`, `num_chunks`, `embed_model`,"
" `embedder_mode` and `chat_model`."
msgstr ""
"`GET /v1/rag/status` 返回 "
"`index_loaded`、`num_chunks`、`embed_model`、`embedder_mode` 和 `chat_model`。"

#: ../developer/rag-chat.md:50
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`POST /v1/rag/chat` takes `{ messages, top_k?, stream? }` (`top_k` 1–20)."
" The model is `RAG_CHAT_MODEL`, fixed on the server, so the endpoint "
"cannot reach role-gated models. Streaming (the default) sends a "
"`{\"type\":\"sources\", ...}` event, the OpenAI-format chunks, then "
"`[DONE]`; non-streaming returns `{ answer, sources, model }`. If the "
"embedding or generation backend is unavailable, it answers `503`."
msgstr ""
"`POST /v1/rag/chat` 接受 `{ messages, top_k?, stream? }`（`top_k` 为 "
"1–20）。模型是服务端固定的 `RAG_CHAT_MODEL`，因此无法通过这个端点访问受角色限制的模型。流式模式（默认）先发送一个 "
"`{\"type\":\"sources\", ...}` 事件，再发送 OpenAI 格式的分块，最后是 `[DONE]`；非流式模式返回 `{"
" answer, sources, model }`。embedding 或生成后端不可用时，返回 `503`。"

#: ../developer/rag-chat.md:52
msgid "Turning it off"
msgstr "关闭助手"

#: ../developer/rag-chat.md:54
msgid ""
"`features.rag: false` in the `SITE_CONFIGURATION` setting turns both "
"endpoints off for everyone, admins included: they answer `403` before "
"reading the index or calling a model. `true`, `null` or no value keeps "
"them on. An invalid site configuration makes both answer `503`; see "
"[Distribution customization](distribution-"
"customization.md#activating-a-manifest). The other model APIs are not "
"affected."
msgstr ""
"在 `SITE_CONFIGURATION` 设置中设置 `features.rag: "
"false`，会为所有人（包括管理员）关闭两个端点：它们在读取索引或调用模型之前就返回 `403`。`true`、`null` "
"或不设置则保持开启。站点配置无效时，两个端点都返回 `503`；参见[发行版定制](distribution-"
"customization.md#activating-a-manifest)。其他模型 API 不受影响。"

#: ../developer/rag-chat.md:56
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "配置"

